{"name": "Sudden Strike 5", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Diary of Corporal Wilson, March 7th, 1945</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Somewhere near Remagen, Germany</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We\u2019ve just taken the bridge at Remagen \u2013 made a breakthrough they never saw coming. Speed was our ally. The day was chill, no snow luckily, but nevertheless our breath was forming clouds in the crisp air. And yet, we took to action, flanked their Pak 40 positions with our Shermans, locked down the east bank with a barrage by 75mm M1 Howitzer and pushed forward before they could react.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The whole thing was wired to blow \u2013 but we moved too fast. They didn\u2019t have time. This wasn\u2019t about firepower, but timing. Planning. Discipline. Every move counted, and we made it to the other side! This could well be the beginning of the end for this gruesome war.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/cda8ae2880fb67507f2a0250296b67fd.poster.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/cda8ae2880fb67507f2a0250296b67fd.webm?t=1785412566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/cda8ae2880fb67507f2a0250296b67fd.mp4?t=1785412566\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sudden Strike 5</strong> delivers real-time tactics in epic WWII battles. A host of tactical options and more than 300 playable units open-up multiple approaches to reach your objectives in a 25 mission campaign on historical battlefields in Europe and North Africa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timing is key, seize opportunities like capturing strategic locations to gain access to reinforcements or destroying bridges to cut-off enemy movement. Outsmart your enemies while managing supplies, and make sure you are in the right place at the right time to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your tactics wisely \u2013 we\u2019ll meet you in the trenches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8a86332b2f074af621569754117fa241.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8a86332b2f074af621569754117fa241.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sudden Strike 5</strong> delivers a truly immersive strategy experience 25 missions across huge, diverse maps and the highest unit counts ever seen in the series, setting the stage for large-scale tactical warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/493562c86c7981a84c53a9e5cd4d0014.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"111\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/493562c86c7981a84c53a9e5cd4d0014.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Command over 300 authentic units \u2013 including more than 190 vehicles and 110 infantry units \u2013 such as the Sherman tank for the Western Allies, the Messerschmitt Bf 109 for the German troops, and the T-34 for the Soviet troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/155e744d731d780566fc5403b97f56b1.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"111\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/155e744d731d780566fc5403b97f56b1.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Utilize unprecedented strategic freedom by choosing your own tactics, units, and objectives to complete the mission goals. Seize and defend key locations like Field HQs, Supply Depots, and Train Stations to gain critical advantages, while using recon, sabotage, alternative routing, and smart unit combinations to outmanoeuvre your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/0716804b029db6e9e0649b574cf6ac9d.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"111\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/0716804b029db6e9e0649b574cf6ac9d.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Choose the Commander that best fits your playstyle and tactics \u2013 whether offensive, defensive, or more tactical. Each brings unique skills that can turn the tide of battle, such as deploying smoke grenades to provide cover on the battlefield or boosting the accuracy of your artillery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/1547cf63e1f820ded7bb0aa1b65fdd3e.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"111\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/1547cf63e1f820ded7bb0aa1b65fdd3e.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Extended camera options let you zoom out for full strategic oversight or zoom in for a closer look at the frontline action, giving you better control over every aspect of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/266b5c0725fc1cbf4f5e37da00a015ec.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"111\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/266b5c0725fc1cbf4f5e37da00a015ec.avif?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Test your strategy against real opponents or AI enemies across multiple difficulty levels, offering competitive PvP challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras_big/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" height=\"11\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/extras/8717a08ba44d4be5eb9a0c7563f02a5a.webp?t=1785412566\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Sudden Strike 5 delivers real-time tactics in epic WWII battles. A host of tactical options and more than 300 playable units open-up multiple approaches to reach your objectives in a 25 mission campaign on historical battlefields in Europe and North Africa.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808550/44da8ebab362939b50d275b0a57fc359cb8f2d05/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1785412566", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "RTS", "World War II", "Action RTS", "Isometric", "Historical"], "developers": "Kite Games", "publishers": "Kite Games", "release_date": "Apr 23, 2026", "price": "$49.99", "appid": "2808550", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1p8DB2hAeoA", "first_seen": 1776895200.0, "review_rank": 823}